t("Each time you consume a mark, you gain %d%% increased attack speed for 2 turns and the cooldown of %d random techniques are reduced by %d turns.", "Cada vez que tú consume una marca, tú gana %d %% aumento de la velocidad de ataque para 2 vueltas y la refrigeración de %d técnicas al azar se reducen por %d vueltas.", "tformat")
t("Relaxed Shot", "Relaxed Disparo", "talent name")
t("Crippling Shot", "Crippling Disparo", "talent name")
t("Pinning Shot", "Pinning Disparo", "talent name")
